<html>
    <head>
        <title>Welcome to Terminus Drive</title>
    </head>
    <body style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;'>
        <div style='max-width: 600px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px;'>
            {{> header}}
            <section>
                <p>Dear {{vendorName}},</p>
                <p>Welcome to Terminus Drive! Your store is now a valued part of our commerce network. Below are your account credentials to get you started:</p>
                <p style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px;">
                    <strong>Login Email:</strong> {{email}}<br>
                    <strong>Temporary Password:</strong> {{temporaryPassword}}
                </p>
                <p>We strongly advise that you log in and update your password immediately for security.</p>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;">
                    <a href='{{loginUrl}}' style='display: inline-block; background-color: #f59e0b; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;'>
                        Go to Merchant Portal
                    </a>
                </div>
                <p>Our support team is always available if you have any questions during your setup process.</p>
            </section>
            {{> footer}}
        </div>
    </body>
</html>